	(text_box "| pin | ESP-12F   | ESP32-C3-12F  |\n|-----|-----------|---------------|\n| 1   | rst       | 0             |\n| 2   | ADC       | 1             |\n| 3   | EN        | EN            |\n| 4   | 16: led_2 | 2: led_2      |\n| 5   | 14: z-c   | 3: z-c        |\n| 6   | 12: re_b  | 4: re_b       |\n| 7   | 13: re_a  | 5: re_a       |\n| 8   | VCC       | VCC           |\n| 9   | nc        | nc            |\n| 10  | nc        | nc            |\n| 11  | nc        | nc            |\n| 12  | 10: nc    | 6: led_1      |\n| 13  | MOSI: nc  | 7: ssr        |\n| 14  | SCLK: nc  | nc            |\n| 15  | GND       | GND           |\n| 16  | 15: ssr   | 8: led_3      |\n| 17  | 2: led_1  | 10: relay     |\n| 18  | 0: boot   | 9: boot       |\n| 19  | 4:        | 18: USB-      |\n| 20  | 5: relay  | 19: USB+      |\n| 21  | rx        | rx            |\n| 22  | tx        | tx            |\n\nboot is also re_btn\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.67 81.28 0)
